      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Add 720p to it too when you're at it.\nFor people with less powerful computers or for taking faster screenshots.\nAnd up to 16K via config file, because why not.\nAlso please remember what resolution we set it to so we don't have to change it every time we play.\nbtw. 1080p = 2K (If 3840 pixels are 4K than half as much, 1920 should be 2K, right)\nYou were probably thinking about 1440p. (Which is more like 3K)\nI have already met people that called all kinds of different resolutions 2K (like Ultra Wide) so to avoid confusion it's better to not use it.\nOfficial 2K is 2048x1080 but I have never seen anything use that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
